  "modules": [
    {
      "id": "uniequip_001_frostl",
      "name": {
        "en": "Frostleaf's Badge",
        "zh": "霜叶证章",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "INITIAL",
      "typeName2": "",
      "icon": "uniequip_001_frostl",
      "description": {
        "en": "Operator Frostleaf has demonstrated a remarkable aptitude for wide-range enemy suppression.\nThe Field Operations Department has thus passed the following resolution:\nThis operator shall be appointed a Guard Operator during field operations to exercise Lord responsibilities.\nIn witness whereof,\nThis badge is hereby conferred upon the above named.",
        "zh": "干员霜叶擅长在较大范围内阻击敌人\n根据外勤部门决议\n在外勤任务中划分为近卫干员，行使领主职责\n特别颁发此证章\n以兹证明",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "uniequip_002_frostl",
      "name": {
        "en": "The Seamless Mixtape",
        "zh": "不歇律动",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "ADVANCED",
      "typeName2": "X",
      "icon": "uniequip_002_frostl",
      "description": {
        "en": "In second pocket of backpack's compartment. Remember to take out before washing.\n—Frostleaf's personal belongings, do not touch.\nMy Backup Mixtape No. 2 Track List\nTotal Length: 36:00\nSide A\n1. Close Your Eyes - The Easy Raindrops (3:27)\n2. Tiptoe Through Siesta – Cape Pianist (3:20)\n3. Green Grapefruit - The Easy Raindrops (3:11)\n(A round-looking fruit is drawn next to it)\n4. The Night Whistles By – Max D.C. Children's Choir (3:30)\n(A note is written in a differently-colored pen: 'A song I listened to as a kid, took a while to find')\n5. A Story of Underground Tunnels and Falling Corn – Beth Grande (4:32)\n(Beneath the comma is a pair of closed eyes)\nSide B\n1. The Disaster I'm In – The Nonbelievers (5:31)\n(A red heart is drawn next to this)\n2. Declared Innocent – The Fire Axes (4:37)\n3. ■■■■■■–■■■■■■ (■:■■)\n(Heavily scribbled out, along with a note written in another color: 'The beat's all wrong. Will get hurt if listened in battle.')\n(There's an arrow pointing to another line of text below that reads 'Storm Riders – The Fire Axes (4:00)')\n4. Taking Back My Tears – Fantasy Realm (3:30)\n\nThis is the second backup tape I've made. The first wouldn't play after being soaked.\nWhile re-recording, I swapped out one song on Side B that didn't fit. It had a weird beat, which messes up my breathing whenever I swung my axe to it.\nBut switching it out left a little gap in the mixtape, and the total playtime went down by 22 seconds. It wasn't seamless anymore.\nWhile worrying about it, I heard the sound of someone practicing an instrument in the dorms. The sound of the metronome was really nice.\nSo I pressed record in the hallway and filled those 22 seconds with the ticking of the metronome.\nI still don't know who was practicing that day, but I'm really grateful to them.\nI know how to write a lot of words now, so I can write all these things down.\nThe nice lady in Medical also encouraged me to write my feelings down more often, but I don't know what words to use to capture my ever-changing mood.\nJust like how every tape has a side A and a side B, our feelings also have sides, and they're always pulsing and changing.\nI like the rhythm when my feelings pulse. Like a drumbeat. Like a metronome swinging from side to side.\nI like a calm rhythm when I'm alone, and an intense one when I'm on a mission. These rhythms are my own, and they won't ever end.\nThere's no room left to write on this paper, so I'll leave it at that.",
        "zh": "放在背包夹层，第二排隔袋里。洗背包之前要记得掏出来。\n——霜叶的个人物品，不让乱拿。\n我的备用磁带2号曲目单\n总时长：36:00\nA面\n1.闭上眼-轻松雨滴乐队 3:27\n2.汐斯塔请踮脚尖-岬角琴手 3:20\n3.绿柚子-轻松雨滴乐队 3:11\n（旁边画着一个圆滚滚的水果）\n4.夜色呼啸而过-麦克斯特区童声合唱团 3:30\n（用另一种颜色的笔写着“小时候听过的歌，找了好久”）\n5.地底隧道，以及玉米落下的故事-贝丝格兰德 4:32\n（在逗号下画着一双闭上的眼睛）\nB面\n1.我所置身的灾难-不信者乐队 5:31\n（旁边画着一个涂成红色的爱心图案）\n2.无罪宣告-消防斧乐队 4:37\n3.■■■■-■■ ■:■■\n（被重重涂掉的一行，旁边用另一种颜色的笔写着“节拍不对，会受伤”）\n（下面有一个箭头指向另一行文字“风暴骑手-消防斧乐队 4:00”）\n4.夺回我的泪水-空想领域乐队 3:30\n\n这是我做的第二盘备用磁带，上一盘泡水过后就无法正常播放了。\n这次重录的时候，换掉了B面的一首不合适的歌。它的节拍很奇怪，如果按这个节拍挥动斧子，呼吸会乱掉。\n但换过歌曲后，总时长少了二十二秒，留下一小段空白，这样就不算无缝混音带了。\n我正烦恼的时候，听到某个宿舍房间里传来练习乐器的声响，节拍器嗒嗒的声音很好听。\n于是我就在走廊里按下录音键，用节拍器的声音补足了二十二秒空白。\n虽然不知道那天是谁在演奏，但确实很感谢。\n我现在会写不少字了，所以能把这些事情都记录下来。\n医疗部的姐姐也鼓励我多记录自己的心情，不过我不知道该用什么字来描述时刻变化的心情。\n就像磁带有A面B面，心情也有不一样的颜色，而且总是一跳一跳的，变来变去。\n我喜欢心情跳动的节奏，像鼓点，像节拍器从这头摆到那头。\n我喜欢一个人待着时平静的节奏，我喜欢执行任务时激烈的节奏。这些都是属于我的，不会停歇的节奏。\n这张纸已经写到最底下了，那么就这样吧。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ],
